85 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 65 0 R
/E (Seaborn is built on top of Matplotlib and provides a higher-level interface for creating attractive statistical graphics. While Matplotlib offers more flexibility and customization, Seaborn simplifies complex tasks like plotting statistical relationships with less code and more aesthetically pleasing defaults.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
