/T (20. What is the difference between count histogram, relative frequency histogram, cumulative frequency histogram and density histogram?)
/E (20. What is the difference between count histogram, relative frequency histogram, cumulative frequency histogram and density histogram?)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
168 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 70 0 R
/E (A count histogram shows the frequency of occurrences of data points in each category. Relative frequency histogram displays the proportion of occurrences relative to the total. Cumulative frequency histogram depicts the accumulation of frequencies as you move along the data. Density histogram represents the frequency density per unit interval, useful for continuous data.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
169 0 obj
<<
